               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-dateModified" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.1/xmi/#ConceptScheme-dateModified" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-dateModified-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.1/xmi/#ConceptScheme-dateModified-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-dateModified"/>
                     <body>Documentation
=============

Original
--------

Reference
.........
schema:dateModified

Definition
..........
The date on which the CreativeWork was most recently modified or when the item's entry was modified within a DataFeed.

Scope
.....
Domain: CreativeWork (https://schema.org/CreativeWork), DataFeedItem (https://schema.org/DataFeedItem).
Range: Date (https://schema.org/Date), DateTime (https://schema.org/DateTime).


CDIF
----

Definition
..........
ISO 8601 date when the codelist was last modified.

Scope
.....
schema:dateModified - ISO 8601 date when the codelist was last modified. Required.
</body>
